                                "sense_id": "3bfc1942-a14a-35cd-9c78-06982e6db5e3",
                                "text": "In the fall of 2016, Mike Judge's 2006 comedy film Idiocracy appeared in select theaters across the United States. Ostensibly a ten-year-anniversary event, the rerelease also happened to coincide with Donald Trump's presidential candidacy and the impending U.S. election."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
